            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.1.10

- Recognize synced Grok Bot profiles in workspace app labels and offer Grok Bot as an app choice without requiring a conversation link.

- Keep linked Cursor workers labeled as Cursor even when another app inspects their workspace.
- Ignore inherited Codex session hints when the calling app is Cursor.
- Match the Codex icon’s size and rounded shape to the other agent app icons, with consistent status badges.
]]></description>
